{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"maxIssuerNumber"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All apps above “twint-issuer39” will always be returned if one of these apps is installed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For this to work, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LSApplicationQueriesSchemes"},{"type":"text","text":" must include “twint-extended”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you configure any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIssuerNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" below 39, the result will always contain all apps above "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIssuerNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"up to and including 39, even if none of them are installed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Additionally, if the fetch fails and the cache is empty, none of these apps will be found when probing."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"important","name":"Important","type":"aside"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct\/Twint-swift.struct\/maxIssuerNumber","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adyen\/adyenactioncomponent\/configuration-swift.struct\/twint-swift.struct\/maxissuernumber"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen","doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenActionComponent","doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct","doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct\/Twint-swift.struct"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The issuer number of the highest scheme you listed under "},{"code":"LSApplicationQueriesSchemes","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"E.g. pass 39, if you listed all schemes from “twint-issuer1” up to and including “twint-issuer39”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The value is clamped between 0 and 39."}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:5Adyen0A15ActionComponentC13ConfigurationV5TwintV15maxIssuerNumberSivp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"Adyen"}],"title":"maxIssuerNumber","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"maxIssuerNumber"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"}]},"references":{"doc://adyen.Adyen/documentation/Adyen/AdyenActionComponent/Configuration-swift.struct":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Configuration","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Action handling configurations."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Configuration","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/adyen\/adyenactioncomponent\/configuration-swift.struct","title":"AdyenActionComponent.Configuration"},"doc://adyen.Adyen/documentation/Adyen/AdyenActionComponent/Configuration-swift.struct/Twint-swift.struct":{"abstract":[],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Twint","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"AdyenActionComponent.Configuration.Twint","url":"\/documentation\/adyen